<%- include('partials/header') %>

<link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/volunteer.css">

<main class="baby-showers-layout baby-showers-main">
  <!-- Keep the Baby Showers page in a sidebar and content card layout without a hero image. -->
  <%- include('partials/volunteerSideMenu') %>

  <div class="page-content baby-showers-page">

    <section class="bs-intro">
      <h1>BABY SHOWERS</h1>

      <h2>
        Looking for a unique and memorable way to celebrate the arrival of a new baby?
      </h2>

      <p>
        Host a baby shower for BKFA and invite your guests to come together and pack birthing kits
        in honour of the mum-to-be and in support of mothers around the world.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="bs-story-section">
      <div class="bs-image-box">
        <img src="/images/clean-birth-kits/Cleos-baby-shower3-e1564571922448.jpg" alt="Baby shower packing birthing kits">
      </div>

      <div class="bs-quote-content">
        <p class="bs-story-intro">
          Cleo recently held a BKFA Baby Shower event and this is what she had to say about the experience:
        </p>

        <blockquote>
          “The decision to not have a baby shower was made very early on by my partner and me.
          However, I still wanted an excuse to have my closest friends and ‘mums’ around for what
          may be for a few of them, a last catch up before the baby!”
        </blockquote>

        <blockquote>
          When researching alternatives to a baby shower, I came across BKFA. I didn’t have much
          time to fundraise but after researching what the BKFA and their networks do for women
          going through pregnancy and birth in developing countries without the supports and
          services we have grown accustomed to – it was a no brainer!
        </blockquote>

        <blockquote>
          Putting together the kits was also a really intimate experience; it is nice to have an event
          so fulfilling, loving and personal with your nearest and dearest while doing something
          bigger than yourself and your baby bubble.”
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bs-book-section">
      <p>
        <strong>
          Book your event by clicking on the button below and download our FREE Baby Shower invite.
        </strong>
      </p>

      <div class="bs-action-buttons">
        <!-- Keep action row labels unbroken so they match the dropdown-style list treatment. -->
        <a href="#baby-shower-form" class="bs-action-box">BOOK A BABY SHOWER</a>

        <a
          href="https://www.bkfa.org.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/BKFA_Baby_Shower_Invitation_Editable.pdf"
          target="_blank"
          class="bs-action-box"
        >
          BABY SHOWER INVITE
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bs-video-section">
      <iframe
        src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/5HT00OpAN3w?start=3"
        title="A baby shower for BKFA"
        allowfullscreen>
      </iframe>
    </section>

    <section id="baby-shower-form" class="bs-form-section">
      <div class="bs-form-container">
        <h2>BOOK A BABY SHOWER</h2>
        <h3>Baby Shower Booking Form</h3>

        <form class="bs-form" method="POST" action="/volunteer/babyshowers">

          <div class="bs-form-row">
            <div>
              <label>Date *</label>
              <input type="date" name="eventDate" required>
            </div>

            <div>
              <label>How many kits would you like to pack?</label>
              <select name="kitQuantity" required>
                <option>40 ($230)</option>
                <option>60 ($345)</option>
                <option>80 ($460)</option>
                <option>100 ($575)</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bs-form-row">
            <div>
              <label>Baby Shower Host First Name *</label>
              <input type="text" name="hostFirstName" required>
            </div>

            <div>
              <label>Baby Shower Host Last Name *</label>
              <input type="text" name="hostLastName" required>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bs-form-row">
            <div>
              <label>Mobile/Phone</label>
              <input type="text" name="phone">
            </div>

            <div>
              <label>Email *</label>
              <input type="email" name="email" required>
            </div>
          </div>

          <label>Mum-to-Be's Name *</label>
          <input type="text" name="mumToBeName" required>

          <label>Fundraising invoice to be sent to:</label>
          <input type="text" name="invoiceRecipient">

          <label>Expected number of guests (for glove supplies) *</label>
          <input type="text" name="guestCount" required>

          <label>Delivery Address for Baby Shower Birthing Kit Supplies *</label>
          <input type="text" name="deliveryAddress" required>

          <label>Street Address</label>
          <input type="text" name="streetAddress">

          <div class="bs-form-row">
            <div>
              <label>Address Line 2</label>
              <input type="text" name="addressLine2">
            </div>

            <div>
              <label>State / Province / Region</label>
              <input type="text" name="state">
            </div>
          </div>

          <label>City</label>
          <input type="text" name="city">

          <label>ZIP / Postal Code</label>
          <input type="text" name="postcode">

          <div class="bs-form-row">
            <div>
              <label>Business/Person’s name *</label>
              <input type="text" name="contactPersonName" required>
            </div>

            <div>
              <label>Telephone/mobile number *</label>
              <input type="text" name="contactPersonPhone" required>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p class="bs-confirm-heading">
            As the designated baby shower event organiser, I will ensure payment is made 4 weeks prior to assembly date or I will contact <a href="mailto:Bookings@bkfa.org.au" class="volunteer-inline-link">Bookings@bkfa.org.au</a> *
          </p>
          <label class="bs-checkbox"><input type="checkbox" name="paymentAgreement" required> I will ensure payment is made 4 weeks prior to assembly date or I will contact <a href="mailto:Bookings@bkfa.org.au" class="volunteer-inline-link">Bookings@bkfa.org.au</a></label>

          <p class="bs-confirm-heading">I confirm I have ensured public liability insurance is in place *</p>
          <label class="bs-checkbox"><input type="checkbox" name="insuranceAgreement" required> I confirm I have ensured public liability insurance is in place</label>

          <p class="bs-confirm-heading">I confirm that I have read and understood the Assembly Day manual *</p>
          <label class="bs-checkbox"><input type="checkbox" name="manualAgreement" required> I confirm that I have read and understood the Assembly Day manual</label>

          <p class="bs-confirm-heading">The venue for the baby shower event is a safe working environment *</p>
          <label class="bs-checkbox"><input type="checkbox" name="safeEnvironmentAgreement" required> The venue for the Assembly Day is a safe working environment</label>

          <p class="bs-warning">
            **We require your booking form submission 8 weeks prior to the date of your Baby Shower event**.
          </p>

          <label>How did you hear about BKFA?</label>
          <select name="heardAboutBKFA">
            <option>Zonta</option>
            <option>Website</option>
            <option>Social media</option>
            <option>Friend or family</option>
            <option>Other</option>
          </select>

          <button type="submit" class="bs-submit">Submit</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
